DHI/ERP Web Portal - API Documentation
This backend is built to handle Admin, Faculty, and Student roles with an integrated "Gatekeeper" approval system.

1. Authentication & Security
Register User: POST /api/auth/register

Body: { "name", "email", "password", "role", "usn", "semester" }

Login: POST /api/auth/login

Body: { "identifier", "password" } (Identifier can be Email or USN)

Note: Students are blocked until an Admin approves them.

2. Bulletin & Notifications
Get All Alerts: GET /api/bulletin/alerts

Feature: Returns a showBadge: true flag if the notice is less than 24 hours old.

Post Notice: POST /api/notices (Admin/Faculty only).

3. Notes Manager
Upload Note: POST /api/notes/upload

Body: { "title", "subject", "semester", "format", "fileUrl" }

Fetch by Semester: GET /api/notes/:sem (e.g., /api/notes/4).

4. Attendance & Leave
Check Attendance: GET /api/attendance/status/:usn

Response: Returns percentage and shortage: true if below 75%.

Apply for Leave: POST /api/attendance/leave/apply.

5. Admin Database & Gatekeeper
View Pending Students: GET /api/admin/students.

Approve User: PATCH /api/admin/approve/:usn.

🕹️ Final Tip for the Home Stretch:
